@guide A_Draenei_Bloodmyst
@name Bloodmyst Isle
@faction Alliance
@races Draenei
@levels 10-20
@zone Bloodmyst Isle
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Kessel's Crossing, Blood Watch, the crystal samples, Wrathscale naga, Vindicator's Rest and the Sun Gate. Ends at 19-20 with the boat from Azuremyst to Auberdine, heading for Ashenvale.
@next A_Ashenvale

